exports[`rendering > renders retention-warning in English 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "“Diwali reel” is deleted in 14 days",
  "text": "Aksharo

This project is due for deletion

Hi Asha, your plan keeps a project's media for a limited time, and “Diwali reel” reaches that limit on 2026-10-01.

Open the project before then to keep it — any activity resets the retention window. After the date, its media is permanently deleted and cannot be recovered.

Open the project:
https://app.example.test/projects/p1

Upgrading your plan also extends how long projects are kept.

Sent by Aksharo. Questions? Reply to this message or write to support@aksharo.ai.
",
}
`;

